    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33253" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκχαυνόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>puff up, make vain and arrogant</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δὲ παίδων χαύνοις φρένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					51
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν] ἐκχαυνῶν λόγοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					412
				</span></i>
