				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.32
			</span></i> O.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸν πολὺν ὄχλον</span>
			<i>to make</i> them <i>gape and stare</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				42
			</span></i>.</div>
